{"word":"ἐπήκοος","uri":"epêkoos","senses":[{"word":"ἐπήκοος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἐπήκοος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">οος,\nοον</span> :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">act.</span> qui prête l’oreille à : <span class=\"grec\">λόγων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">499</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>, à des discours ; <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span>\nqui écoute, <span class=\"ital\">gén.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ag.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1420,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec un dat. de pers.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐπ.\nγονεῦσι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">931</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, qui écoute ses parents ; <span class=\"ital\">cf.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Anth.</span> <span class=\"refch\">9, 303 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec un dat. de\nchose :</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐπ. εὐχαῖς,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Phil.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">25</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, qui\nécoute <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> exauce des souhaits ;\n<span class=\"ital\">abs.</span> qui exauce une prière, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. des dieux,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">O.</span> <span class=\"refch\">14 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1157</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">II</span> <span class=\"ital\">pass.</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qui peut être\nentendu : <span class=\"grec\">παρὰ τῶν θεῶν,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">931</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span>, des\ndieux ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> <span class=\"ital\">au\nneutre, dans les locut.</span> <span class=\"grec\">εἰς\nἐπήκοον</span> <span class=\"ital\">et</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐξ\nἐπηκόου</span> : <span class=\"grec\">εἰς ἐπήκοον στῆσαί\nτινα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 5, 38 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">εἰς ἐπήκοον καλέσασθαί τινα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 3, 1,</span> placer, appeler qqn dans un lieu où il peut\nêtre entendu <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> de manière à ce qu’on\nsoit entendu ; <span class=\"grec\">ἐξ ἐπηκόου,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Char.</span> <span class=\"refch\">20,</span> <span class=\"ital\">m. sign. ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἀναγνῶναι ἐς ἐπήκοον πᾶσι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Conv.</span> <span class=\"refch\">21,</span> lire de façon à être entendu de tous ||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Sup.</span> <span class=\"ital\">neutre</span> <span class=\"grec\">-οώτατον,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ic.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">23</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"fleche\"><span class=\"flechea\">E</span> <span class=\"ital\">Dor.</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἐπάκοος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"refch\">l. c.</span></div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ἐπακούω</span>.</div>\n"}]}